Remove unused expo-image-picker to eliminate camera/photo permissions

expo-image-picker was installed but never imported or used anywhere in
the codebase. Expo's prebuild system (legacyExpoPlugins in
@expo/prebuild-config) auto-applies its config plugin during EAS Build
even without an explicit plugins entry, which would have declared
NSCameraUsageDescription, NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription on iOS and
READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE / WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE on Android.

- Uninstalled: expo-image-picker
- app.json: no camera/microphone permissions were declared (already clean)
- No code changes needed (zero imports existed)
- CAMERA and RECORD_AUDIO are not declared anywhere
